<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-16T22:10:00.605Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:10:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian authorities have arrested the main suspect in the 2013 Baniyas massacres and sentenced two individuals to death for the 2025 coastal sectarian violence. Two Syrian pipelines were damaged in recent attacks on energy infrastructure, including a fire-causing hit on a gas export line in the northeast. Israeli Prime Minister Netanyahu disclosed a direct conversation with President Ahmed al-Sharaa following a 2025 strike in Damascus, which Syrian sources said involved U.S. and Arab mediation. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPS2JjWFgtb3diSHFwYXZ4SnFpdGNndXlsYjJPeDRXSUpoZXI1TkktdTdYQW1DZnBjVWhzZnhMLWhnWXNRX19uYnBmalhyX25HSUd6Z0J2WWRnZFluUFptMWlzbV9odXFaTTVPOXFweE9hRDdoTmhFMkhMVHJnVy01djNOdktQWkZGZ0QxaEFFQ211UDB1VGlEQ3ZIZnJIQXN6OHZjaXNzSzJzUVIwVjRjT0R2T01vczhK?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQdnVjS2Z5NTMwMndLT1d3SXpnNmt2a2xnU21lWE8wQ0lQTTkyUUtKSXdZTkVDNlZFWHREaERBWFF0bkR4Ui0zM3FMc3VGZVB3aHI1LU5UTG5NZXIybjZfQ2xJcDZSMDRYbnBZRmJKRWJXcm5TR1k0SkplZlNXTkljZlpQclJHNjRuSm94S2ZUQVlQSnUwQzEzT0JZWjFrNVA2VGl0VA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
